>

  <section id="summary">
    <article class="overview">
      <p>Virtstart is a virtual assistant platform by the startup FocusFreak. I have worked with the client since the service conception. I was in charge of the usability, user flows, mockups and low, mid and high fidelity prototypes. I designed the landing page and the UI of the webapp.</p>
      <p>Eventually I ended up leading the rest of the project, supervising the webapp development, craft of an MVP and beta testing with real users.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <hr>

  <section id="in-progress">
