    <article>
      <h3>In the meantime...</h3>
      <p>You can read what the engineer I worked with had to say about my time at Focusfreak:</p>

      <blockquote>
        <p>I've worked with Cristian on some of my client's projects, on a freelance/per-project basis. He covered the role of Product Designer.</p>

        <p>Honestly, I value Cristian's work very highly. He has a clear understanding of the client's needs and knows how to communicate clearly; furthermore, his technical knowledge on the development side allows him to have a better understanding of technical possibilites and limitations, making the most out of the potential of the medium (and allowing a very close collaboration during product development iterations).</p>

        <p>Since I shifted from freelancing to full time, we haven't had the opportunity to cross paths lately -- although it would certainly be a pleasure to work together again.</p>

